{"Controls", "SetEnabledPlayer1", ApiKind::Function, "Controls.SetEnabledPlayer1(bool)", "Use this during cutscenes, dialogue, or any time the player shouldn't move. Disabling controls only freezes built-in movement/look - button event callbacks still fire, so menus and dialogue advancement keep working."},
